    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "飞机控制是某些模态弱能控性的一个典型例子。俯仰平面运动主要受升降舵影响，且受滚转运动的影响很弱；滚转运动基本上只受副翼影响。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Airplane control is a good example of weak controllability of certain modes. Pitch plane motion is primarily affected by the elevator and weakly affected by rolling motion. Rolling motion is essentially affected only by the ailerons.",
